flowchart TD
    E0([Technical error from the main flow, the assessment, or the guide]) --> T{"Which part failed?"}

    T -->|"Model service: error, time-out, or quota"| M1["Automatic retry once"]
    M1 --> M2{"Retry succeeded?"}
    M2 -->|Yes| RET([Return to the step where the error happened])
    M2 -->|No| M3["Technical error message: the chat guide and simple wording are temporarily unavailable. Your answers are kept"]
    M3 --> M4[["Quick replies: Try again / Continue without the chat guide"]]
    M4 -->|Try again| M5{"Manual retries used: fewer than 2?"}
    M5 -->|Yes| M6["Retry the model call"]
    M6 --> M7{"Succeeded?"}
    M7 -->|Yes| RET
    M7 -->|No| M4
    M5 -->|No| M8["Stop retrying: please try again later.<br/>Pathway cards, comparison, scoring and reasons still work"]
    M8 --> HUB
    M4 -->|Continue without the chat guide| HUB([Return to hub without the chat guide])

    T -->|"Backend (including scoring) or internet connection lost"| C1["Keep answers and notes in the browser memory for this session"]
    C1 --> C2["Technical error message: connection problem. Your answers are kept in this browser session"]
    C2 --> C3[["Quick replies: Try again / Leave"]]
    C3 -->|Try again| C4{"Retries used: fewer than 3?"}
    C4 -->|Yes| C5["Retry the request"]
    C5 --> C6{"Reconnected?"}
    C6 -->|Yes| RET
    C6 -->|No| C3
    C4 -->|No| C7["Stop retrying: please try again later.<br/>Official information is on the Ministry website [VERIFY: exact official link]"]
    C7 --> FIN
    C3 -->|Leave| FIN([End session with the closing message])
